// Thrusting-sword moveset (WP-051). Source: docs/game/04-arsenal-and-builds.md, "Weapon
// classes": long pierces, counter-hit specialist, fast, 2.4 m reach, Finesse. Frame numbers
// are tuning unless a spec line says otherwise. Dodges (roll, backstep) are shared in
// common.ron; the critical pair is shared in crits.ron, and the weapon's crit_mult_percent
// (100) sets the crit. The counter-hit bonus (Lunging Thrust's 1.3x) is an Art effect and is
// not modeled here.
// total_frames = startup + active + recovery; a hitbox window is (startup, startup + active - 1).
// Schema: crates/content/src/moves.rs.
